'''''Chlorophytum laxum''''' ('''Bichetii grass''', '''Siam lily''', '''false lily turf''', '''wheat plant''') is a flowering plant species in the genus ''[[Chlorophytum]]'', widespread through tropical Africa, Asia, and Australia.

